00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:14.380
VADIM SUPITSKIY: Yeah.

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:16.400
We definitely have
fallen legacy software

00:08:16.400 --> 00:08:18.827
somewhere in the closet
along the way, so.

00:08:18.827 --> 00:08:20.160
WILLIAM ANDERSON: A literal one.

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:21.620
Yeah.

00:08:21.620 --> 00:08:23.570
VADIM SUPITSKIY: And
so doing that step,

00:08:23.570 --> 00:08:25.730
it helped us a lot in the
